	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"『デジモンテイマーズ』より聖騎士型デジモン「デュークモン」をアニメ設定に準拠したデザインとプロポーションで立体化！",
			"• こだわりのパーツ分割で、組み立てるだけで満足のいく仕上がり。",
			"• 関節パーツが広範囲に可動し、劇中さながらのアクションポーズが再現可能。",
			"• 武装には銀色の成形色を使用し、劇中同様の質感を表現。",
			"• 細部にまでこだわり、「聖盾イージス」に刻まれたデジ文字も再現。",
			"• ハンドパーツの他に「聖盾イージス」を保持するための台座も付属。",
			"• デュークモンのマントには布素材を使用。"
		],
		"en": [
			"From \"Digimon Tamers\", the paladin-type Digimon \"Dukemon\" is three-dimensional with a design and proportions that conform to the anime setting!",
			"• With the special division of parts, the finish is satisfactory just by assembling it.",
			"• The joint parts can be moved over a wide area, and the action pose just like in the play can be reproduced.",
			"• Silver molding color is used for armament, expressing a texture similar to that in the play.",
			"• Attention to detail is also reproduced in the digital characters engraved on the \"Holy Shield Aegis\".",
			"• In addition to the hand parts, a pedestal is also included to hold the \"Holy Shield Aegis\".",
			"• Dukemon's cloak is made of cloth material."
		]
	},
